#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_workcenter_scrap_reason.field_scrap_reason_code__mrp_workcenter_ids
msgid ""
"Indicate the work centers that can use this reason code when doing a scrap. "
"If left empy, this reason code can be used with any work center."
